---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 via-white to-accent/5">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-text leading-tight mb-6">
        你的学校，<br class="sm:hidden" />
        <span class="text-primary">准备好了吗？</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-text-light leading-relaxed mb-10">
        2022年，教育部重新定义了"好学校"的标准。<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        核心素养，不再是选择题，而是必答题。
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/why" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">
          👉 了解为什么要做
        </a>
        <a href="/what" class="btn-outline w-full sm:w-auto">
          📖 核心素养是什么
        </a>
        <a href="/start" class="btn-outline w-full sm:w-auto">
          🛠️ 从一个项目开始
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- decorative dots -->
  <div class="absolute top-10 left-10 w-20 h-20 bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-accent/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
</section>
